lingmo-compositor (5.0.4+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Default the mouse to the scrollbar direction rather than the natural
    one. A wheel is pushed down to move the content down; only a touchpad
    follows the fingers. The two shared a default until now.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:26:00 +0800

lingmo-compositor (5.0.3+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Size the action-name table from its own initializers. It was fixed at
    46 entries, and the four media keys made 50, which the compiler
    refuses as too many initializers.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:10:00 +0800

lingmo-compositor (5.0.2+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bring the window a launch opens to the front: the shell mints an
    activation token and hands it to the runtime, and to the program it
    starts itself, instead of passing an empty one.
  * Add hide_application to lingmo-window-hints-v1, so an application can
    hide all of its windows at once, as the shell's Hide does.
  * Drop the power dialog's close button; Cancel is the only way out.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0800

lingmo-compositor (5.0.1+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add the Simplified Chinese translation.
  * Rank launcher search by match quality and by how often an application
  * is used, instead of only filtering.
  * Send the media keys to the session's MPRIS player.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:30:00 +0800

